1091:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_AbortTransmit()
1092:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_AbortReceive()
